  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Ku Mo nearly kills Tie Mu Bai’s four-clawed golden dragon mid-fight, this Gu restores the dragon at once so it can roar and rise back into the clash. Spectating Li Xian recognizes the Gu from that rescue.",
        "chapters": [
          373
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ku_mo"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After killing Tie Mu Bai, Fang Yuan excavates Golden Breeze Gu with the other rank four Gu on that corpse, and those Gu are high quality metal path worms.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In northern plains he activates it after Self-reliance Gu weakens; the Gu is still rank four but only shows rank three efficiency there, and a golden whirlwind spins around him until his wounds are gone. It is still a top quality Gu under that regional drop.",
        "chapters": [
          428
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_reliance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later he sells Golden Breeze Gu with other Gu worms while raising funds.",
        "chapters": [
          581
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
